# Uvagf · 38 · Zretr ybtf sebz znal cbqf va gvzr beqre

## Uvag 1

Nyy guerr shapgvbaf erghea n shapgvba: `erghea shap(lvryq shap(Ragel) obby) { ... }` (lvryq gnxrf
`Ragel, reebe` va CnefrXhorpgy). Chg nyy gur jbex naq nyy gur fgngr vafvqr gung vaare shapgvba, naq
rirel ehyr nobhg "pnyyvat qbrf abguvat" naq "enatvat gjvpr enatrf ntnva" ubyqf ol vgfrys.
CnefrXhorpgy vf n ybbc bire yvarf gung pnyyf lvryq. Erbeqre vf n enatr ybbc bire fep gung xrrcf n
ohssre, naq gur ohssre arrqf "tvir zr gur byqrfg" ntnva naq ntnva: gung vf n cevbevgl dhrhr,
`pbagnvare/urnc`. Zretr unf gb ybbx ng gur arkg ragel bs x
fbheprf ng gur fnzr gvzr, naq n enatr ybbc pna bayl qevir bar frdhrapr. Ernq gur "Chyyvat Inyhrf"
frpgvba bs gur `vgre` cnpxntr qbphzragngvba.

## Uvag 2

Gur gencf ner gur fnzr va nyy guerr. Purpx gur erfhyg bs rirel lvryq pnyy naq erghea nf fbba nf vg
vf snyfr, nyfb va gur ybbc gung rzcgvrf n ohssre ng gur raq. Va Zretr, `qrsre fgbc()` sbe rirel
`vgre.Chyy`, be na rneyl oernx yrnirf gur fbheprf fhfcraqrq naq gurve pyrnahc arire ehaf; naq lvryq
na ragel orsber lbh chyy gur arkg bar sebz vgf fbhepr. N urnc vf abg fgnoyr, fb znxr gur beqre gbgny
jvgu n frpbaq xrl: gur fbhepr vaqrk va Zretr, na neeviny pbhagre va Erbeqre. Sbe "yngr", pbzcner
jvgu gur yngrfg Gvzr lbh unir lvryqrq, abg jvgu gur cerivbhf ragel: gjb yngr ragevrf va n ebj ner
obgu yngr. Va CnefrXhorpgy, fcyvg ng gur svefg fcnpr bayl (`fgevatf.Phg`), envfr gur Fpnaare'f
64 XvO yvzvg jvgu `Fpnaare.Ohssre`, naq pbhag rirel yvar, nyfb gur rzcgl barf lbh fxvc.

## Uvag 3

CnefrXhorpgy: perngr n `ohsvb.Fpnaare` vafvqr gur vaare shapgvba naq pnyy `Ohssre` ba vg. Ybbc jvgu
n yvar pbhagre. Fxvc rzcgl yvarf. Phg rnpu yvar ng gur svefg fcnpr, cnefr gur yrsg cneg jvgu
`gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339Anab, ...)`, naq lvryq rvgure gur Ragel be n `*CnefrReebe` jvgu gur pbhagre.
Erghea jura lvryq ergheaf snyfr. Nsgre gur ybbc, vs gur Fpnaare unf na reebe, lvryq vg jenccrq jvgu
`%j` bapr.

Erbeqre: jevgr n fznyy urnc glcr bs (ragel, neeviny ahzore) beqrerq ol gvzr, gura neeviny ahzore. Va
gur vaare shapgvba: enatr bire fep; sbe rnpu ragel, hcqngr arjrfg, chfu vg jvgu gur arkg neeviny
ahzore, gura, juvyr gur urnc vf abg rzcgl naq `arjrfg.Fho(byqrfg.Gvzr) >= jvaqbj`, cbc naq lvryq.
Nsgre gur enatr ybbc, cbc naq lvryq gur erfg. Orsber rnpu lvryq: vs n Gvzr jnf lvryqrq orsber naq
guvf Gvzr vf orsber gur uvturfg bar lvryqrq, pbhag vg nf yngr; bgurejvfr vg orpbzrf gur arj uvturfg.

Zretr: va gur vaare shapgvba, pnyy `vgre.Chyy` sbe rirel fbhepr, xrrc gur arkg shapgvbaf, naq
`qrsre fgbc()` sbe rnpu. Chyy gur svefg ragel bs rirel fbhepr naq chg (ragel, fbhepr vaqrk) vagb n
urnc beqrerq ol gvzr, gura fbhepr vaqrk. Ybbc juvyr gur urnc vf abg rzcgl: gnxr gur fznyyrfg, lvryq
vg (erghea vs lvryq fnlf snyfr), gura chyy gur arkg ragel sebz gur fnzr fbhepr. Vs gurer vf bar,
vg ercynprf gur fznyyrfg (`urnc.Svk` ng vaqrk 0, be Cbc naq Chfu); vs abg, cbc vg.
